    <!-- <SS:Nexii> Atmo Magic: Clouds > Volumetric Field sub-tab - the
         storm layer's artist baseline. Live coverage/density derive from
         these plus the weather cube's moisture/convection (see
         ssatmoenvcloudfieldstate); the legacy Windlight cloud plane
         (cirrus) is the Sky Dome sub-tab's, untouched by anything here.

         Units live in the parameter label rather than glued to the number,
         same as every other tab - one shared right-aligned spinner column. -->

